  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanenziyi Fesitusi muwulopu owu, chimunahiti mafuku asatu hakufuma kuKesareya, hakuya kuYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi jawatupristu niakulumpi jawaYudeya alema, hiyakumusoŋelela Pawulu kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumulembelela nawu, Atwanakeni mwani, atukwashuku; namutumeshi Pawulu enzi kuYerusalema. Elili nawu amubelamini, akamujahili munjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Fesitusi hakwakula nindi, Pawulu wudi mukaleya kuKesareya, ami aweni keŋa niyi kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi niyi nawakwenu alumbuluka; neyi hadi chuma chatama chaneliyi akamuholokeli tuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimunahiti dehi mafuku atanu nasatu indi kwiji ikumi, hakuya kuKesareya. Chikunachi, hakushakama hetanda dakusompela, hakuleja antu kumuleta Pawulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanenziyi, owu aYudeya afumini na Fesitusi kuYerusalema hiyakwimana kudi Pawulu kwi-ndo, nakumwinka nyiloŋa yatama yayivulu. Hela chochu, hiyatwesheli kumuhishaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulu hakudihakwila nindi, Hela nshimbi jawaYudeya, hela tembeli, hela Kesari, hinayitamishi nihantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Fesitusi, wakeŋa a dehi kuyitiyisha aYudeya kuwaha, hakumwihula Pawulu nindi, Wukwiteja kukanduka kuYerusalema, akakusompesheluku yumiyi kumesu ami, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulu hakwila nindi, Nemani kwami kwitanda daKesari dakusompela, kwateji kunsompeshelawu. Hinakoŋeli aYudeya chatamaku; hela eyi aweni wunelukumu chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi ami nakoŋaŋa chatama, hela neyi nela dehi chuma chatela kufwa, naleki kufwa wanyi. Ilaŋa neyi yananholokeluwu yakutwamba, hikudi muntu wukutwesha kunhana kudi wenaku. Niyi kudi Kesari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fesitusi, chanashakamiyi hampùŋa nachota chindi, hakwakula nindi, Chiwuna lombi kuya kudi Kesari, wakaya kudi Kesari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimunahiti mafuku antesha, Agripa hakushika kuKesareya naBerenisi, nawu amwimwishi Fesitusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaneluwu achidi kulabalaba mafuku amavulu, Fesitusi hakumwawila mwantowu nsaŋu yaPawulu, nindi, Kunu kudi iyala alekelawu munyonji kudi Felisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "China diŋi kuYerusalema, awakulumpi jawatupristu niakulumpi jawaYudeya hiyakumusopelela kudami, nawu nimuhishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuyakula nami, kusha muntu mukaleya chakadi kudi mona nawakwakumuholokela mesu namesu, amoni jakudihakwila nansaŋu yanamuholokeluwu, hichaaku chetwetu aRomaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chapompeluwu kunu, hinalabiluku, ilaŋa dodifuku ŋalondelumu, hinukushakama hetanda dakusompela; hinukuleja antu kumuleta yenowu iyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanemanuwu akwakumuholokela, hiyateneni nyilona yatama yidi neyi munatoŋojokeluku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "komana anamuholokeli tusaŋu twayijila yawu, nimuntu ijina dindi Yesu wafwili, atenaŋayi Pawulu nindi wamumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinelili nami ŋŋinoki mwakwihwila nsaŋu iyi, hinukumwihula nami, Wukwiteja kuya kuYerusalema, akusompesheluku nsaŋu iyi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chaneliyi Pawulu nalombi dehi nindi amuhembaŋa nichamba kamuketwilawu muloŋa kudi Agusitusi, hinukuleja antu nami amuhembi tuhu mukaleya, nichinakamona jakumutemesha kudi Kesari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agripa hakumwila Fesitusi nindi, Ninami nakeŋi kumutiya yeniwu iyala. Fesitusi nindi, Kumaciki wakamutiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunachi Agripa hakwinza naBerenisi, nawanta waweni; hakwijila mwitala dakuhoshela nyiloŋa, hamu nawawakulumpi anjita, niantu amuŋanda alema. Fesitusi hakuleja antu kuleta Pawulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fesitusi hakuhosha nindi, Eyi mwanta Agripa, ninenu amayala ejima tudi nenu munu, iwu iyala munamoni iwu, anamuholokeli kudami kudi aYudeya ejima. KuYerusalema, nikunu nawa, hiyakumbidika nawu hatela kuhanda nawa cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami hinamumoni namuloŋa wakutela kufwaku; dichi chaneliyiyo mweni nalombi dehi nindi ayi kudi Agusitusi hohu, ami hinukwila nami nimutemeshituhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinamoni nsaŋu yalumbuluka yinukusoneka kudi mwanta wamuku; dihu hanafumi kumuleta kumesu enu, nankashi kumesu eyeyi mwanta Agripa, kulonda tumwihujoli, tumoni mwakusoneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa natoŋojoki nami hichikweti maana kutemesha muntu wamukaleya chakadi mukanda wakushimuna nyiloŋa yamuholokelelu wuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
